{
  "info": {
    "name": "SALUD · Organización",
    "description": "Recorrido de un usuario **organización**, en orden y encadenado por el entorno.\n\nAutoregistro del tenant con su cuenta owner, petición de verificación y —una vez que la plataforma la activa— sedes y personal. Mientras está PENDIENTE puede prepararse pero no operar; el paso 5 fija ese límite.\n\nImportar junto a `Salud-Organizacion.postman_environment.json` y correr los pasos de arriba abajo. Cada actor tiene su propio entorno: con uno solo, iniciar sesión como otro borraría este token.\n\nLos pasos son los mismos que ejercita `test/smoke/modules/organizacion.smoke.ts` contra la API real, y `yarn postman:verify:actores` los vuelve a correr sobre esta colección.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 · Se registra con su cuenta owner",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/auth/register-organization",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "auth",
            "register-organization"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"organization\": {\n    \"code\": \"{{orgCode}}\",\n    \"legalName\": \"Organización de prueba\",\n    \"tenantType\": \"HOSPITAL\",\n    \"countryConceptId\": \"{{countryConceptId}}\",\n    \"jurisdictionConceptId\": \"{{jurisdictionConceptId}}\"\n  },\n  \"owner\": {\n    \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n    \"displayName\": \"Owner de prueba\"\n  }\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "description": "Crea tenant, usuario owner, credencial y la membresía OWNER que los une. La organización nace PENDIENTE de verificación."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.environment.set('email', 'owner-' + Date.now() + '@example.test');",
              "pm.environment.set('orgCode', 'ORG-' + Date.now());"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 201', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Encadena el recorrido: lo que deja este paso lo consume el siguiente.",
              "if (pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "  const b = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (b.tenantId) pm.environment.set('tenantId', b.tenantId);",
              "  if (b.ownerUserId) pm.environment.set('ownerUserId', b.ownerUserId);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · El owner inicia sesión de inmediato",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "description": "No espera a la verificación: puede entrar y preparar su organización."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Encadena el recorrido: lo que deja este paso lo consume el siguiente.",
              "if (pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "  const b = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (b.accessToken) pm.environment.set('accessToken', b.accessToken);",
              "  if (b.refreshToken) pm.environment.set('refreshToken', b.refreshToken);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 · Sube su documentación legal",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/common/files",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "common",
            "files"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"originalName\": \"personeria.pdf\",\n  \"category\": \"DOCUMENT\",\n  \"sensitivity\": \"NORMAL\",\n  \"mimeType\": \"application/pdf\",\n  \"sizeBytes\": 16384,\n  \"contentHash\": \"org-{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"storageUri\": \"s3://bucket/personeria.pdf\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": ""
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 201', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Encadena el recorrido: lo que deja este paso lo consume el siguiente.",
              "if (pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "  const b = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (b.id) pm.environment.set('evidenceFileId', b.id);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4 · Pide que la plataforma la verifique",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/identity/me/tenants/:tenantId/verification",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "identity",
            "me",
            "tenants",
            ":tenantId",
            "verification"
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "tenantId",
              "value": "{{tenantId}}",
              "description": "Lo deja en el entorno un paso anterior"
            }
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"evidenceFileId\": \"{{evidenceFileId}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Pedirla es lo máximo que puede hacer: quien contrasta licencia y personería es la plataforma. Auto-verificarse sería un agujero regulatorio."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 201', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5 · LÍMITE · pendiente de verificación no puede abrir sedes",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tenants/:tenantId/branches",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "tenants",
            ":tenantId",
            "branches"
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "tenantId",
              "value": "{{tenantId}}",
              "description": "Lo deja en el entorno un paso anterior"
            }
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"SEDE-PREMATURA-{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"name\": \"Sede prematura\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": "Este paso **debe** dar 422. Preparase sí, operar no: abrir una sede es operar. Se activa en el paso 7."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 422', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6 · SETUP · sesión de la plataforma (credenciales de administrador)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/iam/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "iam",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ],
          "variable": []
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "description": "El único paso que no ejecuta el owner. Está aquí para que el recorrido se pueda correr entero de una vez, y guarda el token en `platformToken` aparte, sin pisar la sesión del owner."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Encadena el recorrido: lo que deja este paso lo consume el siguiente.",
              "if (pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "  const b = pm.response.json();",
              "  if (b.accessToken) pm.environment.set('platformToken', b.accessToken);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7 · La plataforma la verifica y queda ACTIVA",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{platformToken}}"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/tenants/:tenantId/verification",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "admin",
            "tenants",
            ":tenantId",
            "verification"
          ],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "tenantId",
              "value": "{{tenantId}}",
              "description": "Lo deja en el entorno un paso anterior"
            }
          ]
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "description": ""
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('status 200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
